{"id":"m0iikxep7i8uy1hwizccsy0nm","title":"SK-II推出新精华，押注PITERA™科研叙事","originalTitle":"SK-II推出新精华，押注PITERA™科研叙事延伸高端护肤生意","summary":"SK-II在第九届中国国际进口博览会上发布全新护肤浓缩精华液“神仙锁精华”，主打紧致、抗皱和保湿功效，围绕PITERA™做配方延展。品牌公布的研究数据显示，PITERA™能改善基因表达，但功效结论需进一步验证。新品旨在提高客单价并推动多件连带购买，但其市场表现仍待观察。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"36氪"},"links":{"original":"https://36kr.com/p/4062617457235081?f=rss"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-09T14:28:41.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:31.223Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T10:31:31.223Z","category":"drug-therapy","tags":["论文发表","研究成果","DeepMind"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"13794159-19c4-4e50-9fc5-36a675a8dfa9","title":"SK-II发布搭载PITERA™新精华液，市场表现待验证"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"13794159-19c4-4e50-9fc5-36a675a8dfa9","title":"SK-II发布搭载PITERA™新精华液，市场表现待验证"}],"topics":[{"slug":"deepmind","name":"DeepMind"},{"slug":"conference-paper","name":"顶会与论文接收"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fnF2OISkFlzY","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}